Bound the wrong-certificate test, exercise the advertised version matrix,
and keep the restored sender alive until encrypted-file cleanup completes.
SFDONE is published before that cleanup; sleeping after agent disposal
cannot finish work that disposal already cancelled.

Hold partial upload progress in a one-element event queue during restart
tests; consuming progress and then closing races with upload completion.

